elusiveinfusions.journal.blank_infusor=A Blank Infusor, made from iron bars and four iron nuggets. Craft it with harvested Elusive Flora plants to fill it. A finished infusion is placed in a flask's infusion grid, where it works until it is taken out again.$(br2)A Unique infusion allows one of its family per flask. A Stackable infusion may be placed several times, and its small bonuses add up.$(br2)A Concentrated infusion is made from the standard infusion and more of its plants. It is stronger and costs more potency, and it never shares a flask with its standard version.$(br2)An effect infusion gives a potion effect after a completed drink. Effect power makes that effect last longer, up to twice as long by default. It never raises the level.
elusiveinfusions.journal.deepwater_infusion=Crafted from a Blank Infusor with 3 Pearlfrond from the deep ocean floor and 3 Tideheart from the shallows of beaches and oceans. It is Unique: one of its family per flask.
elusiveinfusions.journal.concentrated_deepwater_infusion=Made from a Deepwater Infusion and 3 Pearlfrond from the deep ocean floor and 3 Tideheart from the shallows of beaches and oceans. It is stronger, and it never shares a flask with the standard version.
